    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can draw on the mystical power of night to rise into the air. As a Bonus Action while you are in Dim Light or Darkness, you can magically give yourself a Fly Speed equal to your Speed for 1 minute. You can use this Bonus Action a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
